    "Literal strings and comments are grep/find/read tasks, not graph-symbol retrieval tasks.",
    "The .txt file is intentionally unsupported by the graph parser and must use source-text fallback.",
    "Lexical graph search is not embedding-based semantic search; paraphrases may require targeted source fallback."
